  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nHumans once wielded formidable magical power. But with over 7 billion of us on the planet now, Mana has spread far too thinly to have any effect. When hostile aliens reduce humanity to a mere fraction, the survivors discover an old power has begun to reawaken once again. As the numbers of humanity dwindle from alien bombardment, the creatures of magic, buoyed by the increase in free-floating Mana, begin to re-emerge.  The first to awaken are the elves, who have spent the last few centuries in a magical sleep. Their charms and arrows prove to be surprisingly effective against alien armor, and beam weapons.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 9,
